sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant App1 as App Server 1
    participant App2 as App Server 2
    participant R1 as Redis 1
    participant R2 as Redis 2

    Client->>LB: Request
    LB->>App1: Route request
    App1->>App1: Hash user ID
    App1->>R1: Query Redis 1
    R1->>App1: Response
    App1->>Client: Response

    Client->>LB: Another request
    LB->>App2: Route request
    App2->>App2: Hash user ID
    App2->>R2: Query Redis 2
    R2->>App2: Response
    App2->>Client: Response